    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L10",
     "line": 10,
     "text": "3.1 Initial authorization. A CGRP antagonist is medically necessary when all of the following are",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      252.56,
      497.84,
      264.36
     ]
    },
    {
