     "line": 11,
     "text": "documented:",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      76.0,
      266.16,
      133.81,
      277.96
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L12",
     "line": 12,
     "text": "(a) The member has a diagnosis of migraine with at least 4 migraine days per month in each of the 3",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      282.76,
      536.08,
      294.56
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L13",
     "line": 13,
     "text": "months before the request.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      296.36,
      211.51,
      308.16
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L14",
     "line": 14,
     "text": "(b) The member completed a trial of at least 8 weeks of at least one preferred oral preventive",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      312.96,
      502.73,
      324.76
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L15",
     "line": 15,
     "text": "medication.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      326.56,
      143.13,
      338.36
     ]
    },
    {
     "line_id": "POL-p1-L16",
     "line": 16,
     "text": "(c) The trial in (b) was ineffective or was discontinued because of intolerable adverse effects.",
     "style": "body",
     "bbox": [
      92.0,
      343.16,
      501.61,
      354.96
     ]
    },
    {
